sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Pup as pup CLI
    participant Browser
    participant MCP as MCP Server<br/>(mcp.datadoghq.com)

    User->>Pup: pup mcp list-tools
    Pup->>Pup: Check ~/.config/pup/mcp_token_{site}.json
    alt No token or expired
        Pup->>Pup: Check ~/.config/pup/mcp_client_{site}.json
        alt No client registered
            Pup->>MCP: POST /register (DCR)
            MCP-->>Pup: client_id
            Pup->>Pup: Save client credentials
        end
        Pup->>Pup: Generate PKCE challenge + state
        Pup->>Pup: Start callback server (localhost:8000)
        Pup->>Browser: Open authorize URL
        Browser->>MCP: GET /authorize?client_id=...&code_challenge=...
        MCP->>Browser: Datadog login page
        User->>Browser: Authenticate
        Browser->>Pup: Redirect to callback with auth code
        Pup->>MCP: POST /token (code + verifier)
        MCP-->>Pup: access_token + refresh_token
        Pup->>Pup: Save token to disk (0600)
    end
    Pup->>MCP: Use token for MCP calls
